    "integration_strategy": "After independent development, ensure that the conditional logic in the to_floatable function correctly distinguishes between datetime ('M') and timedelta ('m') types. The combined changes must be verified with integration tests to confirm that polyval yields consistent results across both data types.",
    "communication_needs": "Developers should coordinate on the structure and ordering of the condition checks in to_floatable. They will need to discuss the shared conversion routines and ensure that naming, code style, and logic are consistent so that the final integration does not introduce conflicts in the data processing pipeline."
